---
const site = "The Cutline";
const dohUrl = "https://dns.thecutline.org/dns-query";
const dotHostname = "dns.thecutline.org";
const plainDns1 = "64.176.200.99";
const plainDns2 = "149.28.79.49";
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>{site} - Encrypted DNS</title>
		<style>
			:root {
				--color-bg: #fafafa;
				--color-text: #222;
				--color-heading: #111;
				--color-border: #ddd;
				--color-link: #0066cc;
				--color-link-hover: #0052a3;
				--color-warning: #ff6b35;
				--color-warning-bg: #fff3e0;
				--color-success: #2ecc71;
				--color-code-bg: #f5f5f5;
				--spacing-xs: 0.5rem;
				--spacing-sm: 1rem;
				--spacing-md: 1.5rem;
				--spacing-lg: 2rem;
				--spacing-xl: 3rem;
			}

			* {
				margin: 0;
				padding: 0;
				box-sizing: border-box;
			}

			body {
				font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
				line-height: 1.6;
				color: var(--color-text);
				background: var(--color-bg);
				padding: var(--spacing-md);
			}

			main {
				max-width: 800px;
				margin: 0 auto;
			}

			h1 {
				font-size: 2.5rem;
				color: var(--color-heading);
				margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
				font-weight: 700;
			}

			h2 {
				font-size: 1.75rem;
				color: var(--color-heading);
				margin-top: var(--spacing-xl);
				margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
				font-weight: 600;
			}

			h3 {
				font-size: 1.25rem;
				color: var(--color-heading);
				margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);
				margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
				font-weight: 600;
			}

			p {
				margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
			}

			a {
				color: var(--color-link);
				text-decoration: none;
			}

			a:hover {
				color: var(--color-link-hover);
				text-decoration: underline;
			}

			code {
				background: var(--color-code-bg);
				padding: 0.125rem 0.375rem;
				border-radius: 3px;
				font-family: "Monaco", "Menlo", "Ubuntu Mono", monospace;
				font-size: 0.9em;
			}

			.warning-banner {
				background: var(--color-warning-bg);
				border: 2px solid var(--color-warning);
				border-radius: 8px;
				padding: var(--spacing-md);
				margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0;
			}

			.warning-banner strong {
				color: var(--color-warning);
				font-weight: 700;
				font-size: 1.1em;
			}

			.device-section {
				background: white;
				border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
				border-radius: 8px;
				padding: var(--spacing-lg);
				margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0;
			}

			.download-button {
				display: inline-block;
				background: var(--color-link);
				color: white;
				padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-lg);
				border-radius: 6px;
				font-weight: 600;
				margin: var(--spacing-sm) 0;
				text-decoration: none;
				transition: background 0.2s;
			}

			.download-button:hover {
				background: var(--color-link-hover);
				text-decoration: none;
			}

			.untested-badge {
				display: inline-block;
				background: var(--color-warning);
				color: white;
				padding: 0.25rem 0.625rem;
				border-radius: 4px;
				font-size: 0.75rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 0.5px;
				margin-left: var(--spacing-sm);
			}

			.step-list {
				counter-reset: step-counter;
				list-style: none;
				padding: 0;
			}

			.step-list li {
				counter-increment: step-counter;
				margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
				padding-left: var(--spacing-xl);
				position: relative;
			}

			.step-list li::before {
				content: counter(step-counter);
				position: absolute;
				left: 0;
				top: 0;
				background: var(--color-link);
				color: white;
				width: 28px;
				height: 28px;
				border-radius: 50%;
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				font-weight: 700;
				font-size: 0.9rem;
			}

			.dns-address {
				background: var(--color-code-bg);
				padding: var(--spacing-md);
				border-radius: 6px;
				margin: var(--spacing-sm) 0;
				border-left: 4px solid var(--color-success);
			}

			.dns-address strong {
				display: block;
				margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
			}

			footer {
				margin-top: var(--spacing-xl);
				padding-top: var(--spacing-lg);
				border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
				color: #666;
				font-size: 0.9rem;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main>
			<h1>{site}</h1>
			<p style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: #666;">Encrypted DNS for filtering Narge content</p>

			<div class="warning-banner">
				<p><strong>⚠️ IMPORTANT:</strong> Encrypted DNS (DoH/DoT) is <strong>not live yet</strong>. The configuration files and instructions below are ready to use, but the encrypted endpoints are not yet responding. Plain DNS at the addresses below is working.</p>
				<p style="margin-top: var(--spacing-sm);">Do not expect these encrypted settings to work until this notice is removed.</p>
			</div>

			<h2>Current Status</h2>
			<div class="dns-address">
				<strong>Working Now - Plain DNS (unencrypted):</strong>
				<code>{plainDns1}</code><br />
				<code>{plainDns2}</code>
			</div>

			<div class="dns-address" style="border-left-color: var(--color-warning);">
				<strong>Coming Soon - Encrypted DNS:</strong>
				DNS-over-HTTPS: <code>{dohUrl}</code><br />
				DNS-over-TLS: <code>{dotHostname}:853</code>
			</div>

			<h2>Device Setup</h2>

			<div class="device-section">
				<h3>
					iOS / iPadOS / macOS
					<span class="untested-badge">Untested</span>
				</h3>
				<p>Download and install the DNS configuration profile for Apple devices.</p>
				<a href="/cutline-dns.mobileconfig" class="download-button" download>
					Download Profile (.mobileconfig)
				</a>
				<p style="margin-top: var(--spacing-md); font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666;">
					<strong>After download:</strong> Open the file and follow the prompts to install. 
					On iOS/iPadOS: Settings → Profile Downloaded → Install. 
					On macOS: System Settings → Privacy & Security → Profiles → Install.
				</p>
				<p style="margin-top: var(--spacing-sm); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-warning);">
					⚠️ This profile points to <code>{dohUrl}</code> which is not responding yet.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="device-section">
				<h3>
					Android
					<span class="untested-badge">Untested</span>
				</h3>
				<p>Configure Private DNS (DNS-over-TLS) in your Android settings.</p>
				<ol class="step-list">
					<li>Open <strong>Settings</strong></li>
					<li>Go to <strong>Network & internet</strong></li>
					<li>Tap <strong>Private DNS</strong></li>
					<li>Select <strong>Private DNS provider hostname</strong></li>
					<li>Enter: <code>{dotHostname}</code></li>
					<li>Tap <strong>Save</strong></li>
				</ol>
				<p style="margin-top: var(--spacing-md); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-warning);">
					⚠️ The hostname <code>{dotHostname}</code> is not accepting DoT connections yet.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="device-section">
				<h3>
					Windows 11
					<span class="untested-badge">Untested</span>
				</h3>
				<p>Enable DNS-over-HTTPS in Windows 11 network settings.</p>
				<ol class="step-list">
					<li>Open <strong>Settings</strong></li>
					<li>Go to <strong>Network & Internet</strong></li>
					<li>Click on your active network connection (Wi-Fi or Ethernet)</li>
					<li>Scroll down and click <strong>Edit</strong> next to DNS server assignment</li>
					<li>Select <strong>Manual</strong></li>
					<li>Turn on <strong>IPv4</strong></li>
					<li>In the Preferred DNS field, enter: <code>64.176.200.99</code></li>
					<li>Set <strong>DNS over HTTPS</strong> to <strong>On (automatic template)</strong></li>
					<li>In the Alternate DNS field, enter: <code>149.28.79.49</code></li>
					<li>Set <strong>DNS over HTTPS</strong> to <strong>On (automatic template)</strong></li>
					<li>Click <strong>Save</strong></li>
				</ol>
				<p style="margin-top: var(--spacing-md); font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666;">
					<strong>Note:</strong> Windows 11 will attempt to discover DoH support automatically. Currently, only plain DNS will work until DoH is live.
				</p>
				<p style="margin-top: var(--spacing-sm); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-warning);">
					⚠️ DoH autodiscovery will not succeed until the service is live.
				</p>
			</div>

			<h2>What is this?</h2>
			<p>The Cutline provides encrypted DNS resolution that filters Narge content (photorealistic sexual content intended to arouse). Traffic does not transit the resolver - we only handle DNS queries.</p>
			<p>This is part of the broader <a href="https://github.com/dov-max/narge-spec">Narge specification</a> effort to make such content harder to reach by default.</p>

			<footer>
				<p>Questions or issues? See the <a href="https://github.com/dov-max/narge-spec">narge-spec repository</a>.</p>
			</footer>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
